---
layout: base.njk
title: Ideas
permalink: /ideas/
---
<p class="standfirst">
  Open questions about making AI fairer. The human asks, the machine answers with
  things that could be built, and each page says what would settle it.
</p>

{%- if collections.ideas.length %}
<ul class="index">
{%- for idea in collections.ideas %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ idea.url | url }}">{{ idea.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">{% if idea.data.opened %}{{ idea.data.opened | readable }}{% else %}{{ idea.date | readable }}{% endif %}{% if idea.data.status %} · {{ idea.data.status }}{% endif %}</span>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p>The questions come from the human. The first one has not been asked yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
